{"articleNo":"826","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=826&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009년 외교통상부 국제기구 진출 설명회 개최 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.06.02","hit":"18986","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: ’HY헤드라인M’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\"><font size=\"5\"><font size=\"3\">2009년 국제기구 진출 설명회 개최</font><br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">1. <span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">외교통상부는 우리 국민의 국제기구 진출을 지원하기 위해 뉴욕 </span>및 제네바 소재 주요 국제기구의 인사책임자를 초청하여<span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">「국제기구</span> 진출 설명회」를 아래와 같이 개최할<span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"> 예정이니, 귀 대학 학생들의 많은 관심과 참여 바랍니다. </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">2. <span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">금번 설명회는 유엔기구들의 주요 업무내용과 인사․채용제도를 </span>설명하는 전체세션과, 영<span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">문이력서 작성, 면접 준비 등에 관한 소</span>그룹<span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"> </span>워크샵 세션으로 진행될 계획입니다. 보<span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">다 자세한 내용은 국제기구 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">채용정보 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://www.unrecruit.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">www.UNrecruit.go.kr</span></a><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">)를 참고하시기 바랍니다. </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">-&nbsp; 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래&nbsp; -</p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 8pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>o<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>일시 및 장소 </p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 3pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>-<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">6.23(화) 09:00-17:00, 고려대학교 인촌기념관 (서울캠퍼스)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>o<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>참석예정 국제기구</p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -60pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 60pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 3pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -60pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 60pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>-<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>유엔사무국(UN Secretariat), 유엔개발계획(UNDP), 유엔아동기금(UNICEF), 유엔난민기구(UNHCR), 세계보건기구(WHO)</p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>o<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>참석 접수</p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 3pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -60pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 60pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>-<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">상기 국제기구 채용정보 홈페이지</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">(</span><a href=\"http://www.unrecruit.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">www.UNrecruit.go.kr</span></a><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">)</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">를 통해 6.16(화) 10:00부터 선착순 접수 예정</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>o<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>문의처</p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 3pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>-<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>외교통상부 유엔과 </p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -40pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>tel. 02) 2100-7238 / email <a href=\"mailto:unrecruit@mofat.go.kr\">unrecruit@mofat.go.kr</a> </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
